 with extreme volatility confirmation, ensuring entries during true panic while overriding general negative sentiment. It replaces the fixed stop-loss with a dynamic ATR-based trailing stop, adapting risk to market conditions, a proven success factor. Sentiment weights are slightly adjusted for "strong jobs report" to reflect its generally positive economic impact. These changes aim to increase trade frequency in volatile markets and improve capital preservation, overcoming previous issues of missed opportunities and single losing trades during crises.	064e3f32-f3a1-4f05-a800-402eb82c3d03	2026-06-02 01:39:01.30019-04
